Run a Sounio program using the interpreter

Usage: souc-linux-x86_64 run [OPTIONS] <FILE> [ARGS]...

Arguments:
  <FILE>     Input file
  [ARGS]...  Arguments to pass to the program

Options:
      --use-sounio-compiler  Use the native self-hosted compiler backend instead of the tree-walking interpreter
      --trace-interp         Emit interpreter execution trace to stderr
      --check-only           Run a type-check pass before execution
  -v, --verbose              Enable verbose output
  -h, --help                 Print help
